# Dev panel & FAB add menu

## Bill OCR scan

- **Entry:** `Navbar.jsx` + FAB menu → `BillScannerTool` in a modal
- **Not** a dashboard tool tile — do not add `billScanner` back to `TOOL_ORDER` or `DashboardTools.jsx`
- i18n: `tools.billScanner.*` (modal copy); label in FAB uses `tools.billScanner.title`

## + FAB menu

Four actions: add commitment, scan bill, log daily spend, record lending.

- Long-press **+** opens `LogSpendModal` directly
- When FAB is open, `ToolsDiscoveryToast` hides (`FAB_CHANGE_EVENT` in `constants/fabEvents.js`)
- FAB menu z-index must stay above tools toast (`ct-fab-menu` z-index 85+)

## Dev panel (`import.meta.env.DEV` only)

- Route: `/dev` in `App.jsx` (lazy `DevPanel.jsx`)
- State overrides: `devOverride.js` — hooks `useCommitIntel`, `useStabilityIntel`, `tierAccess`, `ProGate`
- Production builds: no route, no floating button, tree-shaken
- Console: `__perovoDev.help()` via `devSubscriptionTools.js`

## After changing tools or FAB

1. Update `docs/09-implementation-status.md` if product surface changes
2. `npm run audit` + `npm run audit:docs-sync`
